|term[value-object] :status settled :defined-by def-entities-values-promises :anchor entity-value-object
  :word value-object
  :alternates [value-objects value]
  A thing that IS its description — "which one" is a meaningless question.
  |invariants
    - Is the dual of [[term/entity]]
    - Never an [[term/entity]]
    - Cannot dangle, rename, or change; a "changed" value object is a different value object
    - A hash is a complete description compressed into designator shape
